BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rlc-2026-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260819
SUMMARY:RLC 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:Reinforcement Learning Conference\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 
 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://rl-conference.cc/2026/index.html\nVe
 nue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#rlc-2026\nNotes: Third 
 RLC (annual since 2024). Official pages confirm Aug 15-18\, 2026 at Unive
 rsité de Montréal (Aug 15 workshops\, Aug 16-18 main program). Accepted
  papers appear in the Reinforcement Learning Journal (RLJ\, ISSN 2996-857
 7) after double-blind OpenReview review\; one author must attend in perso
 n. The abstract deadline was extended from March 1 to March 5 AoE\, the p
 aper cutoff\, so it is kept as a schedule-only step. The submission site 
 was to open by February 17 (no time given). No official acceptance rate w
 as found. Size M rests on 148 RLJ 2026 papers in the official paper sched
 ule\; attendance is unpublished. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Reinforcement Learning,Machine Learning
URL:https://rl-conference.cc/2026/index.html
LOCATION:Montreal\, Canada
END:VEVENT
