 s://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#rlc-2027\nNotes: The RLC 2026 site ann
 ounces RLC 2027 at two in-person sites: Brown University\, USA (early Aug
 ust) and Odense\, Denmark (late August\, one joint event with EWRL)\; exa
 ct dates are TBA and authors of accepted papers choose where to present. 
 Aug 1-31 bounds both sites\; it is not a shift of Aug 15-18\, 2026. No 20
 27 call is published\; abstract Mar 1 and paper Mar 5 AoE are one-year pr
 oxies from the original 2026 call (2024: Mar 1/8\; 2025: Feb 21/28)\, wit
 h the abstract assumed mandatory. The RLJ home page now describes quarter
 ly volumes with rolling submissions\, so the 2027 route may change. Size 
 is an editorial estimate.
